       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Acetaminophen 3000 mg three times daily comes to 9,000 mg/day, which is more than twice the usual maximum of 4,000 mg/day for a 70 kg adult with normal liver function. Many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. A dose that high risks serious hepatotoxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily** (3,000 mg/day)\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,600 mg/day)\n- **1000 mg PO every 8 hours**, which is the same total as the first option\n\nIf you do want 3000 mg three times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
